From: Robert Marko <robert.marko@sartura.hr>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 17:45:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: handle missing managed property

The managed property is optional, but airoha_pcs_init() passes its value
to strncmp() without checking whether dev_read_string() returned NULL.

Treat a missing property as disabled in-band negotiation.

Signed-off-by: Robert Marko <robert.marko@sartura.hr>
---
 drivers/net/airoha_eth.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/drivers/net/airoha_eth.c
+++ b/drivers/net/airoha_eth.c
@@ -750,7 +750,8 @@ static int airoha_pcs_init(struct udevice
 	port->pcs_dev = pcs_dev;
 	port->mode = dev_read_phy_mode(dev);
 	managed = dev_read_string(dev, "managed");
-	port->neg_mode = !strncmp(managed, "in-band-status",
+	port->neg_mode = managed &&
+			 !strncmp(managed, "in-band-status",
 				  sizeof("in-band-status"));
 
 	airoha_pcs_pre_config(pcs_dev, port->mode);
